==Battleground==
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zamelle]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Ancient Egg: N205 (Special Cat)|Bride Cat]] and [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] to stall the opening wave of enemies. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] can handle the Zuches and Aku Doges well enough with good meatshielding, so just save up enough cash to afford generic Super Rare attackers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] preferably. The boss wave enemies won't be capable of pushing nearly hard enough before they're all eradicated, leaving just basic peons and Zamelle by their lonesome. Kill them.

